operatives.abilities:
Cold-Blooded: Whenever this operative is shooting against, fighting against or retaliating against a wounded enemy operative, this operative’s weapons have the Lethal 5+ weapon rule;
if that enemy operative is also injured, this operative’s weapons also have the Rending weapon rule.

Hardy: Whenever an attack dice would inflict Critical Dmg on this operative, you can choose for that attack dice to inflict Normal Dmg instead.
